parameters.help_en:
List of features. You can specify up to 50 items in one request. The format is as follows:

functionName (required): Name of the feature. For supported features, see https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/388460.html. Separate multiple parameters with commas (,).

argName (required): Configuration item for functionName. You can specify multiple configuration items.

argValue (required): Value for the configuration item of functionName.

parentid (optional): ID of a rule condition. By configuring the condition function (rules engine) in https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/388460.html, you can create rule conditions that match and filter user requests based on parameters in the request. Each rule condition generates a https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/388994.html after creation. This configid can be used as a ParentId parameter referenced by other feature functions, enabling flexible combinations of rule conditions and feature configurations.

If parentId is set to -1, the existing rule condition for this configuration is deleted.

```[{
   "functionArgs": [{
     "argName": "Feature parameter A", 
     "argValue": "Value for Feature parameter A"
    }, 
  {
    "argName": "Feature parameter B", 
    "argValue": "Value for Feature parameter B"
     }], 
 "functionName": "Feature name",
 "parentId": Optional. ConfigId of the referenced rule condition
}]
```

Example without using parentId:
To add an origin HTTP request header using the origin_request_header function, use the following request parameters:

```[{
        "functionArgs": [{
            "argName": "header_operation_type",
            "argValue": "add"
        }, {
            "argName": "header_name",
            "argValue": "Accept-Encoding"
        }, {
            "argName": "header_value",
            "argValue": "gzip"
        }, {
            "argName": "duplicate",
            "argValue": "off"
        }],
        "functionName": "origin_request_header"
}]
```

Example using parentId:
To add an origin HTTP request header using the origin_request_header function and reference a rule condition with configid=222728944812032, use the following request parameters:

```[{
        "functionArgs": [{
            "argName": "header_operation_type",
            "argValue": "add"
        }, {
            "argName": "header_name",
            "argValue": "Accept-Encoding"
        }, {
            "argName": "header_value",
            "argValue": "gzip"
        }, {
            "argName": "duplicate",
            "argValue": "off"
        }],
        "functionName": "origin_request_header",
        "parentId": 222728944812032
}]
```

Example to remove a parentId reference from an existing configuration:
The origin_request_header function currently references a rule condition with configid=222728944812032. To remove this reference, use the following request parameters:

```[{
        "functionArgs": [{
            "argName": "header_operation_type",
            "argValue": "add"
        }, {
            "argName": "header_name",
            "argValue": "Accept-Encoding"
        }, {
            "argName": "header_value",
            "argValue": "gzip"
        }, {
            "argName": "duplicate",
            "argValue": "off"
        }],
        "functionName": "origin_request_header",
        "parentId": -1
}]
```

parameters.help_zh:
功能列表，一次传入最多50条，格式如下：

functionName（功能名称，必填）：可配置功能请参见https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/388460.html，多个参数之间用半角逗号（,）分隔。
argName（参数名称，必填）：functionName的配置项（可配置多个配置项）。
argValue（参数值，必填）：functionName的配置项的取值。
parentid（规则条件ID，非必填）：通过配置https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/388460.html中的功能函数**condition**（规则引擎），可以创建出规则条件（规则条件可以通过识别用户请求中携带的各种参数来匹配和过滤用户请求），每一个规则条件被创建以后都会生成一个对应的https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/388994.html，configid可以被当作ParentId参数被其他功能函数引用，这样规则条件就可以与功能配置一起组合形成更灵活的配置。

parentId为 -1：表示删除该配置里面已有的规则条件。
```[{
   "functionArgs": [{
     "argName": "功能参数A", 
     "argValue": "功能参数A对应的值"
    }, 
  {
    "argName": "功能参数B", 
    "argValue": "功能参数B对应的值"
     }], 
 "functionName": "功能名称",
 "parentId": 选填项，对应引用规则条件的configid
}]
```
不使用parentId的情况下，配置示例如下：
使用函数origin_request_header添加回源HTTP请求头的时候引用了configid=222728944812032的规则条件，请求参数如下：
```[{
        "functionArgs": [{
            "argName": "header_operation_type",
            "argValue": "add"
        }, {
            "argName": "header_name",
            "argValue": "Accept-Encoding"
        }, {
            "argName": "header_value",
            "argValue": "gzip"
        }, {
            "argName": "duplicate",
            "argValue": "off"
        }],
        "functionName": "origin_request_header"
}]
```
使用parentId的情况下，配置示例如下：
使用函数origin_request_header添加回源HTTP请求头的时候引用了configid=222728944812032的规则条件，请求参数如下：
```[{
        "functionArgs": [{
            "argName": "header_operation_type",
            "argValue": "add"
        }, {
            "argName": "header_name",
            "argValue": "Accept-Encoding"
        }, {
            "argName": "header_value",
            "argValue": "gzip"
        }, {
            "argName": "duplicate",
